Symbolic: M1 = T*r ; M2 = r*(2*N_anc + T) ; M3 = S_obs*r/r_SNV
Sensitivity (elasticities): dlnM1/dln r = 1 ; dlnM1/dln T = 1 ; dlnM2/dln T = T/(2*N_anc + T)

